h2 What You Will Do on FreshView
p - Please read <strong>all posts and comments</strong>. You'll be asked about your impression of them later, so your attention is vital.
p - <strong>Like or comment</strong> on posts you find interesting or worth responding to.
p - <strong>Flag or respond</strong> to anything that feels inappropriate or violates community guidelines.
p - Please spend at least <strong>5–10 minutes</strong> engaging before moving on. When you're done, click <strong>"Proceed to Post-Study Survey"</strong> at the bottom of the feed. After completing the survey, you'll receive your study completion code and be redirected to Prolific.
  
p When you are ready, click <strong>"Enter Feed"</strong> to start engaging with the FreshView community!
